  "description": "This resource pack takes vanilla textures and forces them to cycle every 10 seconds.",
  "body": "# 10-Second Vanilla Randomizer # \nWatch your world constantly shift. This resource pack takes standard vanilla textures and forces them to cycle every 10 seconds (200 ticks).\n\n\n## Features\n**Fully Randomized**: Applies to both block and item textures.\n\n**Vanilla Friendly**: Uses 100% standard Minecraft 16x16 assets.\n\n\n\n## Installation\nDownload the .zip file.\nPlace the file into your %appdata%\\.minecraft\\resourcepacks folder.\nLaunch Minecraft 26.1.2.\nGo to Options > Resource Packs and enable the pack.",
